BT 1 0 0 1 0 50 Tm .916489 Tw 9.6 TL /F4 7.6 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (Commercial aviation networks operate as tightly coupled queueing systems. A) Tj T* 0 Tw .483855 Tw (minor disturbance at a hub airport cascades across the national airspace system,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.0871 Tw (generating downstream delay propagation. In response, airline dispatchers and) Tj T* 0 Tw .803333 Tw (air traffic control command centers require predictive decision support capable) Tj T* 0 Tw .196436 Tw (of forecasting arrival delays of 15 minutes or greater \() Tj (ARR_DEL15) Tj (\) well before) Tj T* 0 Tw (departure.) Tj T* ET
