BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.2 Tm .077111 Tw 9.6 TL /F4 7.6 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (However, standard machine learning pipelines frequently suffer from severe data) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.33252 Tw (leakage by conditioning on actual departure delays, ground taxi-out times, or) Tj T* 0 Tw .36352 Tw (post-departure telemetry. In this work, we enforce a strict operational boundary:) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.3418 Tw /F2 7.6 Tf (all features must be definitively known 60 minutes prior to scheduled) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.09328 Tw (departure \(T - 60 min\)) Tj /F4 7.6 Tf (. We benchmark linear baselines, gradient boosted) Tj T* 0 Tw .003644 Tw (decision trees \(GBDTs\), tabular neural networks with learned entity embeddings,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.6216 Tw (and temporal sequential models, followed by an offline tactical rescheduling) Tj T* 0 Tw (simulation.) Tj T* ET
